n)<br></li><li>Achievements: 51 achievements to conquer. (Steam Integration)<br></li><li>Straight to Action: No running around with lots of texts or customizations that take hours. Just enjoy a single-player campaign full of action, strategy and challenge!<br></li><li>6 levels and a boss: The game counts with 6 levels and a final boss for you to beat!<br></li><li>Steam Cloud Integration</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714300/extras/ba2a1f3a526c7578d5c9478618fb0d02.poster.avif?t=1635534689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714300/extras/ba2a1f3a526c7578d5c9478618fb0d02.webm?t=1635534689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714300/extras/ba2a1f3a526c7578d5c9478618fb0d02.mp4?t=1635534689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
